# No upstream code

Do not copy, port, translate, or mechanically rename code from **Aetherphone**, **Aetheros**, or the old Linkpearl fork. This rebuild is independent. Reading those trees only as a behavioral reference (what a feature does) is allowed. Using their files as an implementation source is not, under any circumstance.

Write Linkpearl types, HTTP, UI, and crypto from Pearlgate contracts and this repo's own architecture. If a feature already exists in Aetherphone or Aetheros, design it again here. Do not open those codebases to "match their structure."
